\uc1\pard\ulnone\b\f0\fs20 Stonegale Crags\b0\par
\fs16\par
The Stonegale Crags contain numerous ore deposits as well as other valuable minerals. A group of brave clonks have agreed to descend into the crags to mine the ore, despite the hostile environment.\par
\par
While the steep cliffs of the crags already offer a challenge to any settling clonks, there are much greater difficulties they will have to overcome. Constant rockfalls bombard all of the tunnels and crevices, and the area is also volcanically active. Only with skill and sharp wits can the clonks hope to succeed.\par
\par
The goal is to mine and sell all ore.\par
